event: thinking
data: {"id": "435b1f2531594263-thinking-parallel_evidence-1563", "run_id": "435b1f2531594263", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据工具执行结果，我已获得关键事实：\n\n**已确认的根因事实：**\n\n1. **ConfigMap 缺失**：Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 依赖一个名为 `unavailable-config` 的 ConfigMap 作为卷挂载（volume \"input\"），但该 ConfigMap 不存在。\n\n2. **Pod 状态为 Pending**：由于挂载失败，Pod 一直处于 Pending 状态，容器处于 ContainerCreating 阶段。\n\n3. **持续失败事件**：\n   - `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（85s 内发生50次）\n   - `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]`（16m 内持续发生）\n\n**关于失败的日志查询：**\n之前尝试通过 observability Pod 查询日志失败是因为权限问题", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788421140804, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
